msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"This place has the best yakiniku anywhere. I'm gonna eat sooo much. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Let's go inside, then."
msgstr "Entriamo, allora."

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Right! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Giusto! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"This place has the best yakiniku anywhere. I'm gonna eat sooo much. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "...Hold on a second. I just realized I'm short on cash."
msgstr ""
"Ehm... Aspetta un attimo. Mi sono appena reso conto che sono a corto di "
"grana."

msgctxt "196"
msgid "What? Kiryu-san, what do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Oh, okay... Guess that's it, huh? I'm going home. Maybe we can try again "
"another time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(I'd better bring enough cash next time...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Phew... That was delicious. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I think I ate a whole "
"farm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Glad to hear you liked it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Thank you for the meal, Kiryu-san.<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"That was super fun. I hope you'll take me out again. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""
"Mi sono divertita un mondo. Spero che mi porterai fuori di nuovo. "
"<Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Later, Kiryu-san. Stop by the club soon, 'kay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Thank you for treating me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr "Figurati."

msgctxt "436"
msgid "I could eat yakiniku forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Glad to hear it."
msgstr "Mi fa piacere."

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Later, Kiryu-san. Stop by the club soon, 'kay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Nothing... I just kinda didn't like that..."
msgstr "Niente... Solo che non mi è piaciuto granché..."

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "532"
msgid "I'm going to head home. I'll see you at the club..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "(I shouldn't have made her eat something she didn't like...)"
msgstr ""

